  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-extract-image",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：图像提取转换服务\n\nMCP服务器提供从本地文件、URL提取图像并转换为base64格式的功能，适用于LLM分析。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **extract_image_from_file** — Extract and analyze images from local file paths. Supports visual content understanding, OCR text extraction, and object recognition for screenshots, photos, diagrams, and documents.\n- **extract_image_from_url** — Extract and analyze images from web URLs. Perfect for analyzing web screenshots, online photos, diagrams, or any image accessible via HTTP/HTTPS for visual content analysis and text extraction.\n- **extract_image_from_base64** — Extract and analyze images from base64-encoded data. Ideal for processing screenshots from clipboard, dynamically generated images, or images embedded in applications without requiring file system access."
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-extract-image\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-extract-image\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
